A block of weight $15\,\mathrm{N}$ hangs by a wire from a remotely controlled aircraft, as shown in Fig. 2.1.

{{figure:figure_2_1.png}}

The aircraft is used to move the block only in a vertical direction. The force on the block due to air resistance is negligible.
The variation with time $t$ of the vertical velocity $v$ of the block is shown in Fig. 2.2.
The velocity is taken to be positive in the upward direction.

{{figure:figure_2_2.png}}
